WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.600
Muslims believe every
baby is born with fitrah:

2
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.170
a natural disposition
to know and worship God.

3
00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:10.710
The Qur'an calls humans
God's trustees on earth.

4
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:14.880
And it describes life as a
test of who is best in conduct.

5
00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:20.440
If Muslims say people are born good, why
does everyone still need a path to follow?

6
00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:24.980
In this mission, you'll follow the journey
Muslims believe every soul makes after

7
00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:25.760
death.

8
00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:30.820
Then you'll compare how Sunni and Shi'a
Muslims set out the duties of faith.

9
00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:36.520
Your mission: find out why, for Muslims,
people born good still need a path.
